<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, May 20 - Karachi - Vessels waiting off port, one general cargo waiting for two days. Two oil tankers, first waiting for two days. Five other vessels waiting off port for own reasons.</p>
